   "description": "Normally the mapped Snag Description cell. NOT required (ADR-0019): a human tick at import is authoritative, so a ticked row with no description is still imported -- falling back to the row's first non-empty cell, or blank when the row has nothing anywhere. Never a manufactured placeholder.",
