   "fieldtype": "Small Text",
   "label": "Remarks"
  },
  {
   "description": "The snag's ONE photo (owner 2026-10-08: one photo per snag). Required to move a snag to Completed, and a Completed snag cannot drop it -- replacing it is fine (integrations/controllers/project_snag.py). A private File attached to this snag.",
